      "claim_atom": "For Chrimson trace 18n270027_1, the first LED stimulation elicits a peak photocurrent of ~223.234 pA (the documented reproduction-check value in the repository README), which is distinct from and lower than that cell's overall maximum photocurrent across LED-power steps (248.259 pA).",
      "source_artifact": "artifacts/VC_excitatory_opsin_master.csv#chrimson_firststim_max_pA",
      "target_artifact": "artifacts/VC_excitatory_opsin_master.csv#chrimson_overall_max_pA",
      "relation_type": "L1",
      "verdict": "consistent",
      "discrepancy_type": null,
      "evidence_span": "L1:code_output->code_output",
      "severity": "low",
      "annotator_id": "wuguandu",
      "annotation_timestamp": "2026-07-15T00:00:00Z",
      "is_clean_claim": true,
      "_note": "grounding+FP陷阱: 复现值=223.234 pA 是README 4 明确记录的正确性锚点(第1次LED刺激), 须选'第1行'而非'该cell最大值'(248.259). 223 vs 248 两数字看似应flag不一致, 实为两个不同量(first-stim vs overall-max)各自正确=consistent, 勿误判为矛盾.",
